<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
Primitive Algebraic Points on Curves
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>
